{
  "sceneId": "scene-01",
  "text": "You might have heard things about investing from friends, family, or social media. There are a lot of misconceptions out there. So we're here to give you the facts. Myth one: investing is hard and complicated, and it's only for Boomers. Wrong. Anybody can invest, and Bloom makes it easy. Over one million users are already learning and investing on Bloom. Myth two: you need a lot of money to start. Wrong. On Bloom, you can start investing with just one dollar. Even small amounts can grow big over time. Myth three: I don't have time to invest now, so I'll start later. Wrong. Bloom lets you learn and invest at your own pace. The earlier you start, the more time your money has to grow. Myth four: I'll lose all my money. Investing is super risky. Wrong. You can always choose safer investments, and Bloom teaches you exactly what to pick. Stop guessing. Get Bloom and start investing today.",
